  "body": "In preparation for ai mode, moving from an explicit cancel button to a back button that replaces the submit button (there's already a search button on the keyboard) allows us to get rid of the previous cancel button.\r\n\r\nthe loading icon still replaces the back button like it used to with submit.\r\n\r\nThis is still allowed as we are in experimental autocomplete.",
